---
description: File-based PM — claim tasks by editing pm/tasks frontmatter
globs:
  - pm/tasks/**
  - pm/streams.md
---

Claim: `status: in_progress`, set `assignee`, bump `updatedAt` (ISO UTC). Done: `status: done`, set `completedBy`, `completedAt`, bump `updatedAt`. Commit: `git commit -s`. Streams: edit table in `pm/streams.md` only; tasks use `stream: <id>`. See `AGENTS.md`.
